# CVE-2024-29409: FileTypeValidator only checked client-supplied mimetype, allowing trivial spoofing.
# Backport of upstream nestjs/nest PR #14881 / #14948 adapted for @nestjs/common 9.0.7.
# Uses file-type@16.5.4 (fromBuffer API) — last CJS-friendly major; v20 needs Node 18+ while Nest 9 supports Node 12+.
# file-type is a hard dependency so magic-number validation works at runtime without a peer install.
